# Gitignored assets copied into each new worktree (.gitignore syntax).
# A worktree is a fresh checkout, so these would otherwise be missing and
# require a full `yarn install`. Only paths that are also gitignored are copied.
node_modules
.husky/_
.yarn/install-state.gz
.env.local
# 로컬 전용 docs(.gitignore 참고). docs/ 자체는 추적 폴더가 있어 늘 존재하므로
# 하위 폴더 단위로 적어야 post-checkout 훅의 "이미 있으면 건너뜀"에 걸리지 않는다.
docs/README.md
docs/architecture
docs/reference
docs/qa
docs/workflows
docs/superpowers
docs/__agents_only__
